blocks.en:
located (Boolean): Does the think text mention or describe
the corresponding event or observation anywhere? Count a semantic match;
exact wording and timestamps are not required.

blocks.zh:
地点(博莱安): 思维文本是否提及或描述
相应的事件或观察在哪里? 计算语义匹配;
不需要准确的措辞和时间戳。
